## 8. TEST API (THUNDER CLIENT / POSTMAN)
```http
### Đăng nhập
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Lấy thông tin user (cần token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lấy danh sách folder
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo folder
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test folder"
}

### Lấy từ trong folder (có lọc level)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/folders/<folder_id>/words?level=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Học từ mới - lấy batch
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/learning/folders/<folder_id>/new-words?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chấm điểm 1 bước
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/learning/words/<word_id>/check-answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "step": "spelling",
    "answer": "apple"
}

### Hoàn thành 1 từ (học mới)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/learning/words/<word_id>/complete-learn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
```
