## 9. CẤU HÌNH FILE `.env`
```env
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@host:5432/postgres

# Flask
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key
JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret

# Server
FLASK_APP=run.py
FLASK_ENV=development
```
